{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o102a","title":"公卿廷议李丰等谋反赞钟毓科律论断","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o102a-account","label":"《诸夏侯曹传第九》正文","text":"公卿廷议李丰等谋反赞钟毓科律论断","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o102a-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"year":254,"label":"嘉平六年二月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xiahoucao-y254","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xiahoucao-q-o100","basis":"嘉平六年二月"},"evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o102a-q","xiahoucao-q-o100","shaodi-q-o059","shaodi-q-b-91c7db3288e80e5b9e4b"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-o102a-q","source_order":[9,585,"O102a"],"order":2342}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-q-b-91c7db3288e80e5b9e4b","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-91c7db3288e80e5b9e4b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗六年：嘉平六年（公元 254）。己丑：旧历初一日。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":275,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-386affd091adab4ef2df","start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o059","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-83849af55ebd17291970","layer":"original","quote":"六年春二月，己丑〖1〗，镇东将军毌丘俭上言：“昔诸葛恪围合肥新城，城中遣士刘整出围〖2〗，传消息，为贼所得。考问所传，语整曰：‘诸葛公欲活汝，汝可具服〖3〗。’整骂曰：‘死狗，此何言也！我当必死为魏国鬼！不苟求活逐汝去也。欲杀我者，便速杀之！’终无他辞。又遣士郑像出城传消息。或以语恪，恪遣马骑寻围迹索，得像还。四五人的头面缚〖4〗，将绕城表。敕语像〖5〗，使大呼，言：‘大军已还洛，不如早降！’像不从其言，更大呼城中曰：‘大军近在围外，壮士努力！’贼以刀筑其口，使不得言。像遂大呼，令城中闻知。整、像为兵，能守义执节，子弟宜有差异〖6〗。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":266,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":271,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o102a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-6ed786fd6b8fbe32a71a","layer":"original","quote":"于是会公卿朝臣，廷议，咸以为：“丰等各受殊宠，典综机密；缉承外戚椒房之尊〖13〗；玄备世臣〖14〗。并居列位〖15〗，而包藏祸心，搆图凶逆；交关阉竖，授以奸计；畏惮天威，不敢显谋，乃欲要君胁上〖16〗，肆其诈虐；谋诛良辅，擅相建立〖17〗；将以倾覆京室〖18〗，颠危社稷。毓所正皆如科律〖19〗，报毓施行。”","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":584,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":154,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o100","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-23e2c5b4fe1020c88bf5","layer":"original","quote":"嘉平六年二月，当拜贵人〖5〗。丰等欲因御临轩〖6〗，诸门有陛兵〖7〗，诛大将军；以玄代之，以缉为骠骑将军。丰密语黄门监苏铄、永宁署令乐敦、冗从仆射刘贤等曰〖8〗：“卿诸人居内，多有不法；大将军严毅，累以为言。张当可以为诫〖9〗！”铄等皆许以从命。﹝二﹞","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":582,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":126,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
